y</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Cordier-Bussat</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Philippe</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2002</year><article-title>An arginine to cysteine(252) mutation in insulin receptors from a patient with severe insulin resistance inhibits receptor internalisation but preserves signalling events.</article-title><source>Diabetologia</source><volume>45</volume><fpage>657</fpage><lpage>667</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12107746</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pcbi.1000096-Khan1"><label>12</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Khan</surname><given-names>MN</given-names></name><name><surname>Savoie</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Bergeron</surname><given-names>JJM</given-names></name><name><surname>Possner</surname><given-names>BI</given-names></name></person-group><year>1986</year><article-title>Characterization of rat liver endosomal fractions. In vivo activation of insulin-stimulable receptor kinase in these structures.</article-title><source>J Biol Chem</source><volume>261</volume><fpage>8462</fpage><lpage>8472</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3522569</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pcbi.1000096-Klein1"><label>13</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Klein</surname><given-names>HH</given-names></name><name><surname>Freidenberg</surname><given-names>GR</given-names></name><name><surname>Matthaei</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Olefsky</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name></person-group><year>1987</year><article-title>Insulin receptor kinase following internalization in isolated rat adipocytes.</article-title><source>J Biol Chem</source><volume>262</volume><fpage>10557</fpage><lpage>10564</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3038888</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pcbi.1000096-Kublaoui1"><label>14</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kublaoui</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Pilch</surname><given-names>PF</given-names></name></person-group><year>1995</year><article-title>Dynamics of signaling during insulin-stimulated endocytosis of its receptor in adipocytes.</article-title><source>J Biol Chem</source><volume>270</volume><fpage>59</fpage><lpage>65</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7814420</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pcbi.1000096-Wang1"><label>15</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Balba</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Knutson</surname><given-names>VP</given-names></name></person-group><year>1996</year><article-title>Insulin-induced in situ phosphorylation of the insulin receptor located in the plasma membrane versus endosomes.</article-title><source>Biochem Biophys Res Commun</source><volume>227</volume><fpage>27</fpage><lpage>34</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8858098</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pcbi.1000096-Carpentier1"><label>16</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Carpentier</surname><given-names>J-L</given-names></name><name><surname>Paccaud</surname><given-names>J-P</given-names></name><name><surname>Gorden</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Rutter</surname><given-names>WJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Orci</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><year>1992</year><article-title>Insulin-induced surface redistribution regulates internalization of the insulin receptor and requires its autophosphorylation.</article-title><source>Proc Natl Acad Sci U S A</source><volume>89</volume><fpage>162</fpage><lpage>166</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1729685</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pcbi.1000096-Carpentier2"><label>17</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Carpentier</surname><given-names>J-L</given-names></name><name><surname>Paccaud</surname><given-names>J-P</given-names></name><name><surname>Baecker</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Gilbert</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Orci</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>1993</year><article-title>Two steps of insulin receptor internalization depend on different domains of the beta-subunit.</article-title><source>J Cell Biol</source><volume>122</volume><fpage>1243</fpage><lpage>1252</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8376461</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pcbi.1000096-Ljung1"><label>18</label><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ljung</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><year>1999</year><source>System identification&#x02014;theory for the user</source><publisher-loc>Upper Saddle River (New Jersey)</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Prentice-Hall</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="pcbi.1000096-Schoeberl1"><label>19</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Schoeberl</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Eichler-Jonsson</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Dieter-Gilles</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Muller</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><year>2002</year><article-title>Computational modeling of the dynamics of the MAP kinase cascade activated by surface and internalized EGF receptors.</article-title><source>Nature Biotech</source><volume>20</volume><fpage>370</fpage><lpage>375</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="pcbi.1000096-Sedaghat1"><label>20</label><citation cit